        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="one warp slot is drawn. the datapath is replicated ×12 per subcore. the fetch-redirect port, the IF11 dispatch port and the RAS aggregation are shared and serve one selected slot per cycle." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#777777;" vertex="1" parent="1">
